<description><![CDATA[<i>SWOT SCIENCE ORBIT</i><br><br>
Producer: CNES / Nicolas Tchintcharadze<br>
Version date = May 2018<br><br>
<i>Initialized to have:<br>
- Science-pass#332 = CalVal-pass#28<br>
- pass#332 Descending Node at -144.67433 deg of longitude</i><br><br>
<u>Orbit parameters:</u><br>
N+P/Q = 13+19/21<br>alt ~ 890 km / inc = 77.6 deg <br>
Cycle duration ~ 21 days (20.86455) / Sub-cycle ~ 10 days<br>
292 orbits per cycle<br> Orbital period (s) = 6131.62<br><br>
Reference file: ephem_science_june2015_ell-v2.txt<br><br>
Contact: <a href="mailto:claire.pottier@cnes.fr?subject=[SWOT] KML file of Science orbit">claire.pottier@cnes.fr</a><br><br>
<i>For illustration only.<br>
User to verify all information.</i>]]></description>
